  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Boil the kettle.\n• Cut Malaysian tofu into 2cm cubes.\n• Thinly slice carrot and zucchini into half-moons.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-677f6c9c06ac089a9b2abdb3-153d7743.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Half-fill a medium saucepan with boiling water.\n• Cook egg noodles over medium-high heat, stirring occasionally with a fork to separate, until tender, 4-5 mins.\n• Drain, rinse and set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-677f6c9c06ac089a9b2abdb3-c894aff2.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, in a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook tofu, turning until browned, 3-4 mins. Cook in batches if your pan is getting crowded. Transfer to a bowl and cover to keep warm.\n• Return frying pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook carrot and zucchini until slightly softened, 4-5 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-677f6c9c06ac089a9b2abdb3-cf759a1e.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Add coconut milk, green curry powder, the water, soy sauce, brown sugar, and vinegar to the veggies. Simmer until slightly reduced, 1-2 mins.\n• Remove from heat and stir through egg noodles. Season to taste.\n• Divide green curry curry noodles with mixed veggies between bowls. Top with tofu to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-677f6c9c06ac089a9b2abdb3-538db801.jpeg"
    }
  ]
